{"id":"598545","name":"椒香黄瓜条","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/598545/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小黄瓜","amount":"1000g"},{"name":"椒盐","amount":"50g"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"大辣椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"子姜","amount":"250g"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"200g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小黄瓜和辣椒洗净，晾一天，蔫蔫巴巴的即可。","img":"images/598545/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"子姜和大蒜洗净晾干水分。","img":"images/598545/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小黄瓜切条。","img":"images/598545/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放容器内，放食盐。","img":"images/598545/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀，腌制几小时。","img":"images/598545/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取辣椒。","img":"images/598545/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"切条","img":"images/598545/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大蒜和子姜改刀，跟辣椒放一起。","img":"images/598545/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"取生抽。","img":"images/598545/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放锅里煮开，放凉。","img":"images/598545/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"生抽凉透，放白糖。","img":"images/598545/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放白酒。","img":"images/598545/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/598545/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放大蒜等，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/598545/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"腌过得黄瓜条放蒸笼里。","img":"images/598545/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"全部放上。","img":"images/598545/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"用重物压出水分。","img":"images/598545/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放大蒜里。","img":"images/598545/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/598545/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"热锅冷油，取辣椒和干辣椒。","img":"images/598545/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"油热放花椒等。","img":"images/598545/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"辣椒变色关火，放椒盐粉。","img":"images/598545/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"把拌匀的黄瓜条放椒盐油锅中，拌匀。","img":"images/598545/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/598545/step_24.jpg"}],"tips":"没有椒盐，就多放花椒，有椒香味才好吃。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}